      <title>8月股票亏了以后，我做了个 Codex 微信工作台</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260814/8%E6%9C%88%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E4%BA%8F%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%A5%E5%90%8E%E6%88%91%E5%81%9A%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%AA-Codex-%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0/</link>
